# The journal role's self-declaration, synced in like the rest of skel/. Engine-owned: a site
# that wants to say more (its canonical url, an id) SHADOWS it — commit its own copy and add
# --exclude='journal.yml' to the rsync in the engine's bin/sync.sh. Left ignored, this node's
# claim is carried by atlas.yml, which already declares the same url.
/journal.yml
